  "captions": [
    {"startSeconds":1.64,"endSeconds":4.60,"text":"Bakit nga ba hindi reliable ang somatotypes?"},
    {"startSeconds":4.84,"endSeconds":8.00,"text":"Mainly ectomorph, endomorph, and mesomorph?"},
    {"startSeconds":13.56,"endSeconds":14.56,"text":"Here's the reality."},
    {"startSeconds":15.16,"endSeconds":16.84,"text":"Again, here's the reality."},
    {"startSeconds":16.90,"endSeconds":20.00,"text":"Somatotypes aren't rooted in modern exercise science."},
    {"startSeconds":20.26,"endSeconds":22.08,"text":"Inimbento 'to noong 1940s"},
    {"startSeconds":22.12,"endSeconds":25.38,"text":"ng isang psychologist named William Herbert Sheldon."},
    {"startSeconds":25.72,"endSeconds":28.50,"text":"And get this, hindi man lang fitness o metabolism"},
    {"startSeconds":28.50,"endSeconds":29.56,"text":"ang pinag-aralan niya."},
    {"startSeconds":29.82,"endSeconds":33.30,"text":"He used constitutional psychology para subukang patunayan"},
    {"startSeconds":33.54,"endSeconds":36.32,"text":"na your body shape dictates your personality"},
    {"startSeconds":36.78,"endSeconds":38.86,"text":"intelligence, and tendencies sa delinquency."},
    {"startSeconds":43.46,"endSeconds":46.48,"text":"Modern exercise physiology has debunked this over and over."},
    {"startSeconds":46.58,"endSeconds":49.58,"text":"Ang katawan natin is polygenic at infinitely"},
    {"startSeconds":49.58,"endSeconds":53.00,"text":"more complex kaysa sa three arbitrary boxes."},
    {"startSeconds":53.24,"endSeconds":55.58,"text":"Somatotype isn't a genetic blueprint."},
    {"startSeconds":55.66,"endSeconds":58.56,"text":"It's a snapshot of your current energy balance,"},
    {"startSeconds":58.66,"endSeconds":60.00,"text":"muscle mass, and lifestyle."},
    {"startSeconds":63.08,"endSeconds":65.72,"text":"Stop limiting yourself, okay?"},
    {"startSeconds":65.96,"endSeconds":69.52,"text":"Ectomorph ako kaya di ako nagkakalaman."},
    {"startSeconds":70.16,"endSeconds":71.16,"text":"Again."},
    {"startSeconds":71.36,"endSeconds":72.66,"text":"Kaya stop limiting yourself."},
    {"startSeconds":72.70,"endSeconds":76.18,"text":"Ectomorph ako kaya hindi ako masyado nagkakalaman?"},
    {"startSeconds":76.26,"endSeconds":79.22,"text":"Or endomorph ako kaya doomed na akong tumaba?"},
    {"startSeconds":79.34,"endSeconds":83.04,"text":"You are not trapped in a label made in the 1940s."},
    {"startSeconds":83.26,"endSeconds":84.08,"text":"Control your nutrition,"},
    {"startSeconds":84.18,"endSeconds":87.64,"text":"train hard and stop capping your own potential."},
    {"startSeconds":87.76,"endSeconds":88.46,"text":"So yun lang naman, guys."},
    {"startSeconds":88.60,"endSeconds":90.00,"text":"Like and follow if you're a science-based person."},
    {"startSeconds":90.28,"endSeconds":91.00,"text":"It's a big blessing."},
    {"startSeconds":91.16,"endSeconds":93.34,"text":"Kasi dami pa ring naniniwala dito."},
    {"startSeconds":93.58,"endSeconds":94.84,"text":"That's why I made a video about it."}
  ],
